(doc
  (title "Step 1: Swift Project Setup")
  (source-format markdown)
  (converted "2026-07-19")
  (kv "Version" "0.1.0")
  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "Set up the Swift Package with dependencies, configuration, and basic directory organization. This creates the foundation for building the YX protocol Swift implementation."))
  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "Creates the Swift Package Manager project: `Package.swift` with `YXProtocol` library, `YXProtocolTests` test target, and `SwiftSender`/`SwiftReceiver` executable targets. Configures CryptoKit and Network framework dependencies."))
  (section
    (heading "Step Objectives")
    (item "1. Create Swift Package manifest (Package.swift)")
    (item "2. Set up directory structure for sources and tests")
    (item "3. Configure dependencies (CryptoKit for HMAC/AES)")
    (item "4. Create initial module structure")
    (item "5. Verify Swift environment"))
  (section
    (heading "Prerequisites")
    (item "Step 0 completed (BUILD_CONFIG.json exists)")
    (item "Swift {{CONFIG:swift_version}} or later installed")
    (item "Swift Package Manager available"))
  (section
    (heading "Traceability")
    (kv "Implements" "protocol/specs/architecture/implementation-languages.sxp § Swift Considerations")
    (kv "References" "protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp (Security requirements)"))
  (section
    (heading "Instructions")
    (subsection
      (heading "Before Starting — Record Start Time")
      (para "Record the current timestamp in ISO 8601 format: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ` This is used for duration calculation in the DONE file."))
    (subsection
      (heading "1. Navigate to Build Directory")
      (code "cd builds/{{CONFIG:build_name}}"))
    (subsection
      (heading "2. Initialize Swift Package")
      (code "swift package init --type library --name YXProtocol"))
    (subsection
      (heading "3. Create Package.swift")
      (para "Create `Package.swift`:")
      (code "// swift-tools-version: 5.9
// Implements: protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp

import PackageDescription

let package = Package(
    name: \"YXProtocol\",
    platforms: [
        .macOS(.v13),
        .iOS(.v16)
    ],
    products: [
        .library(
            name: \"YXProtocol\",
            targets: [\"YXProtocol\"]
        ),
    ],
    dependencies: [],
    targets: [
        .target(
            name: \"YXProtocol\",
            dependencies: [],
            path: \"Sources/YXProtocol\"
        ),
        .testTarget(
            name: \"YXProtocolTests\",
            dependencies: [\"YXProtocol\"],
            path: \"Tests/YXProtocolTests\"
        ),
    ]
)"))
    (subsection
      (heading "4. Create Directory Structure")
      (code "mkdir -p Sources/YXProtocol/Transport
mkdir -p Sources/YXProtocol/Primitives
mkdir -p Tests/YXProtocolTests/Unit
mkdir -p Tests/YXProtocolTests/Integration"))
    (subsection
      (heading "5. Create Initial Module Files")
      (para "Create `Sources/YXProtocol/YXProtocol.swift`:")
      (code "//
//  YXProtocol.swift
//  YX Protocol - Secure UDP-based networking protocol
//
//  Implements: protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp
//

import Foundation

/// YX Protocol version
public let version = \"0.1.0\""))
    (subsection
      (heading "6. Create README.sxp")
      (para "Create `README.sxp`:")
      (code "# YX Protocol - Swift Implementation

Secure, payload-agnostic UDP-based networking protocol.

## Overview

This is the Swift implementation of the YX protocol as specified in:
- `../../protocol/specs/technical/yx-protocol-spec.sxp`

## Building

```bash
swift build")))
  (section
    (heading "Running Tests")
    (code "swift test"))
  (section
    (heading "Project Structure")
    (code "Sources/YXProtocol/       # Source code
  Transport/              # UDP transport layer
  Primitives/             # Core data structures
Tests/YXProtocolTests/    # Test suite
  Unit/                   # Unit tests
  Integration/            # Integration tests"))
  (section
    (heading "Specifications")
    (para "Built following YBS (Yelich Build System) methodology.")
    (para "See `../../protocol/specs/` for complete specifications.")
    (code "
### 7. Create .gitignore (in build directory)

Create `.gitignore`:
"))
  (section
    (heading "Swift")
    (para ".DS_Store /.build /Packages /*.xcodeproj xcuserdata/ DerivedData/ .swiftpm/"))
  (section
    (heading "Build artifacts")
    (para "BUILD_STATUS.sxp SESSION.md BUILD_CONFIG.json docs/build-history/")
    (code "
### 8. Build Package

```bash
swift build")
    (section
      (heading "Verification")
      (para "**This step is complete when:**")
      (item "[ ] `Package.swift` exists with correct configuration")
      (item "[ ] Directory structure created (`Sources/YXProtocol/`, `Tests/YXProtocolTests/`)")
      (item "[ ] Initial module file created")
      (item "[ ] Package builds successfully")
      (item "[ ] Tests can be discovered (even if none exist yet)")
      (para "**Verification Commands:**")
      (code "# Verify Package.swift exists
test -f Package.swift && echo \"✓ Package.swift exists\"

# Verify directory structure
test -d Sources/YXProtocol/Transport && \\
test -d Sources/YXProtocol/Primitives && \\
test -d Tests/YXProtocolTests/Unit && \\
test -d Tests/YXProtocolTests/Integration && \\
echo \"✓ Directory structure created\"

# Verify package builds
swift build && echo \"✓ Package builds successfully\"

# Verify tests can run (even with no tests)
swift test && echo \"✓ Tests can run\"

# Verify module imports
swift run -c release --build-path .build -Xswiftc -I -Xswiftc .build/release <<EOF
import YXProtocol
print(\"✓ YXProtocol module version: \\\\(version)\")
EOF")
      (para "**Expected Output:**")
      (code "✓ Package.swift exists
✓ Directory structure created
✓ Package builds successfully
✓ Tests can run
✓ YXProtocol module version: 0.1.0")
      (para "**Retry Policy:**")
      (item "Maximum 3 attempts")
      (item "If swift build fails: Check Swift version, retry")
      (item "If directory creation fails: Check permissions, retry")
      (item "If 3 failures: STOP and report error"))
    (section
      (heading "Notes")
      (item "This step creates the foundation for all subsequent Swift steps")
      (item "CryptoKit (built-in) provides HMAC-SHA256 and AES-256-GCM")
      (item "Swift Package Manager handles dependencies and building")
      (item "Directory structure follows Swift best practices")
      (item "macOS 13+ and iOS 16+ required for modern async/await support"))
    (section
      (heading "Documentation")
      (para "**Record end time** and calculate duration (end − start timestamp).")
      (para "Create `docs/build-history/ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6-DONE.txt`:")
      (code "STEP ybs-step_a1b2c3d4e5f6: Swift Project Setup
STARTED:    [start timestamp from Before Starting]
COMPLETED:  [ISO 8601 timestamp]
DURATION:   [minutes]

OBJECTIVES COMPLETED:
[copy from Step Objectives above]

FILES CREATED/MODIFIED:
- Package.swift
- Sources/YXProtocol/YXProtocol.swift
- Tests/YXProtocolTests/

VERIFICATION: PASSED (attempt [N])

NEXT STEP: ybs-step_b2c3d4e5f6a1 (GUID Factory)")
      (para "Update `BUILD_STATUS.sxp`: mark this step `[x]` and update **Last Updated** timestamp."))
    (section
      (heading "Success Criteria")
      (para "This step is successful when:")
      (item "1. All verification checks pass (within 3 attempts)")
      (item "2. All required files exist and are valid")
      (item "3. Build compiles/runs without errors")
      (item "4. DONE file created in `docs/build-history/`")
      (item "5. `BUILD_STATUS.sxp` updated"))
    (section
      (heading "Next Steps")
      (para "After completing this step, proceed to:")
      (kv "Next" "`ybs-step_b2c3d4e5f6a1` — GUID Factory"))
    (section
      (heading "Version History")
      (subsection
        (heading "0.1.0 (2026-04-11)")
        (item "Initial step creation")))))
